While playing hack, I happened upon a couple of my ghosts (one of which had
a blessed +3 plate mail!!!!--ok, not a lot, but very nice if you're still
wearing chain mail) and their piles of possessions.  Being a priest, I knew
what was cursed, what was not, etc., but I couldn't understand when some of
the objects listed came up as:

	-a cursed DUAM ZNAT wand
	-a cursed ELBIB YLOH wand

and so on.  Later on, a found a similar wand, and when I identified it, I
discovered that it was indeed
	
	(d) a wand of enchant armor

Deciding to be cautious, I tested the wand and watched as a bolt of fire
bounced around the room.  Some enchantment!

Further, the game gave me some sort of comment about the name being wrong and
suggested that I exit the game.  All of this happened *after* I found the 
ghosts....

